WEBVTT

00:13:58.709 --> 00:14:00.043
And it just makes me --

00:14:00.085 --> 00:14:03.130
I can see the future when I'm with them.

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:05.382
That's what gives me hope.

00:14:06.592 --> 00:14:08.051
PM: And joy.

00:14:08.927 --> 00:14:12.222
We hear from a lot of people,
though, you know,

00:14:12.264 --> 00:14:14.850
will say back to a story like that,

00:14:14.892 --> 00:14:17.144
well, that person's an elected official

00:14:17.185 --> 00:14:20.397
or they've already taken
a leadership position.

00:14:20.397 --> 00:14:23.191
And often you'll hear individuals say,

00:14:23.233 --> 00:14:26.486
"I just don't know what I can do

00:14:26.528 --> 00:14:28.822
as an individual in the community."

00:14:28.864 --> 00:14:30.699
How do you respond to that?